Opacity sweep (200², same method): 0.85→9.21, 0.82→8.89, **0.80→8.66**, 0.78→8.46, 0.75→8.12,
0.72→7.86. Dark coverage at 0.80 is 10.97%, so C3's ≤25% ceiling is not threatened. No threshold
change or adjudication is requested — C5 now passes on its stated terms.

